sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator as Tenant Admin / assigned Site Manager
    participant UI as Map editor
    participant API as Commissioning API
    participant GIS as PostGIS / version store
    participant Audit as Activation audit
    participant Runtime as Edge / occupancy runtime
    actor Guard as Security Guard

    Operator->>UI: Edit slot polygon, code, zone, state
    UI->>UI: Immediate native-pixel validation
    UI->>API: PUT draft + If-Match(mapId:lockVersion)
    alt stale lock
        API-->>UI: 409 current version metadata
        UI-->>Operator: Stop autosave; compare/export/load server
    else saved
        API->>GIS: Validate and increment lock version
        API-->>UI: Draft + new ETag
        UI-->>Operator: Saved timestamp
    end

    Operator->>UI: Validate and review Publish summary
    UI->>API: Validate candidate against active site layout
    API->>GIS: Check source, calibration, polygons, codes, zones and partitions
    GIS-->>API: Structured validation result
    API-->>UI: Feature-linked errors or valid summary

    Operator->>UI: Confirm Publish
    UI->>API: Publish + If-Match + Idempotency-Key
    API->>GIS: Revalidate; archive old camera version; activate candidate atomically
    API->>Audit: Record actor, versions, result and correlation
    API-->>UI: Published version + audit reference + ETag
    Runtime->>API: GET published slot map + If-None-Match
    API-->>Runtime: New immutable geometry + calibration + ETag
    Guard->>API: Read assigned-site published occupancy map
    API-->>Guard: Published geometry/occupancy only

    Note over UI,Runtime: Draft and invalid geometry are never runtime-readable
    Note over API,Audit: Rollback repeats current site-wide validation and requires a reason

